    <unit id="=&gt;q4" name="=&gt;q4">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">8</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::Darkness, all you see is darkness, but blind you are not.

Naked, you are lying naked, your elongated belly relaying to you the gentle vibrations of the cold dirt.

You feel hunger.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q5" name="=&gt;q5">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">10</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::Eyes, another pair of eyes appear opposite you.

Big and round, they gaze at you with utter fear.

Their trembling excites you, and you slither toward them...::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q6" name="=&gt;q6">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">12</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::Triumph, the last thing you feel is triumph...::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
